From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:13:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: share pump fence collection and signalling

K2: keep default mode 1 at the same point before admission, with the same runtime/engine lock drop and reacquire order. Share the collector with mode 2 and the signal operation with all three paths. Keep the allocation-failure fallback, cursor correction and mode-0 one-job behaviour. The early_signal interface stays because retained lab scripts read and write it.
